<title>SWITZERLAND: Alusuisse expands auto parts diecasting.</title>
<headline>Alusuisse expands auto parts diecasting.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG said it would expand its automotive components business by taking joint ownership in a Slovenian diecasting plant and investing in new capacity at an Alusuisse diecasting plant in Germany.</p>
</text>
